  "description": "An Office-style ribbon for WinUI 3: tabs and groups that degrade as the window narrows - items step down through their size variants and a group that no longer fits collapses into a drop-down button instead of disappearing - with exactly one live instance per item, hosted WinUI controls that keep the focus, and a programmatic API on a par with the XAML one.",
